  ('TF-11-02','Last and Best',11,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','What is the fun-walk raising money for?','new books and a reading corner','a football pitch','a party',0,'What does Emeka do when Nanya is slow?','leaves her and catches the fast pack','stays and walks at her pace','carries her the whole way',1,'What does Emeka say the real win was?','coming first','being fastest','finishing together',2,'Write the word: journey','journey','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TF-11-03','Chidera and the Fierce Dragon',11,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','What does Chidera imagine the loud cutting machine is?','a fierce dragon','a train','a robot',0,'What is being made at the shop?','a car','a new gate for the estate','a bed',1,'What does the worker give Chidera?','a sweet','a book','a little steel star, a ''dragon''s scale''',2,'Write the word: dragon','dragon','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TF-11-04','The Marvellous Catch',11,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','What does the photo make it look like Mayomi did?','an amazing football catch','scored a goal','won a race',0,'What was Mayomi really doing when the photo was taken?','diving for the ball','reaching for his chin chin snack','sleeping',1,'Why does the estate celebrate Mayomi in the end?','for the catch','for scoring','for being honest about the truth',2,'Write the word: honest','honest','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TFT-11-01','Why the Dog Lives with People',11,'Tafiya Folktale','comprehension','Why is the dog unhappy in the wild?','he is cold, hungry and pushed away','he is bored','he is lost',0,'Who is kind to the dog?','the lion','a child by the fire','the wild animals',1,'Why does the dog stay with people?','he is trapped','he cannot find the bush','he chooses the warmth and kindness he found',2,'Write the word: dog','dog','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TF-11-05','Titi''s Marvellous Machine',11,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','What does Titi want to do?','send a treat up to Mimi the cat','build a car','win a race',0,'Instead of the simple way, what does Titi do?','asks Emeka to help lift it','builds a big complicated machine','climbs the wall',1,'How does Mimi react to the marvellous machine?','she runs off','she is scared','she is completely unbothered',2,'Write the word: machine','machine','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('SF-11-01','The New Twins',11,'Stamina Fiction','comprehension','Why do the twins keep to themselves at first?','they are lonely and homesick','they are proud and stuck-up','they dislike the estate',0,'Who works out the real reason?','Wali','Grema','Itohan',1,'What finally helps the twins feel at home?','a football match','a new flat','hearing their home song played for everyone',2,'Write the word: twins','twins','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('SN-11-01','How the Patterns Get In',11,'Stamina NF','comprehension','What are the two main ways to get a pattern into cloth?','painting and printing','resisting the dye, or weaving it in','cutting and gluing',1,'What does ''resist'' mean here?','stopping the dye from reaching some parts','washing the cloth','folding it',0,'What colour is the famous indigo dye?','red','green','deep blue',2,'Write the word: cloth','cloth','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TD-11-01','A Midsummer Night''s Dream',11,'Tafiya Duniya','comprehension','Who is the tricky fairy servant who causes the muddle?','Puck','Oberon','Bottom',0,'What does the magic flower juice do?','makes you sleep','makes you love the first thing you see','makes you invisible',1,'What does Puck do to Bottom?','turns him to stone','makes him fly','gives him a donkey''s head',2,'Write the word: dream','dream','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TF-12-01','Remi Looks Up',12,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','How does Remi feel about the space trip at first?','he thinks space is useless, a waste of time','thrilled','scared',0,'What surprising fact changes Remi''s mind?','rockets are fast','Nigeria has its own satellites watching over the land','stars are hot',1,'What does Remi do at home that evening?','plays football','sleeps early','goes out and looks up to watch for the satellite',2,'Write the word: satellite','satellite','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TF-12-02','The Wrong Trophy',12,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','What appears by the gate?','a trophy','a bike','a box of books',0,'How does Tombari work out who it belongs to?','she guesses','she checks the inscription and the evidence, not the loudest claim','she asks Nana',1,'What does Tombari learn?','the loudest person is always right','trophies are fun','being certain is not the same as having evidence',2,'Write the word: careful','careful','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TN-12-01','The Giants in the Ground',12,'Tafiya NF','comprehension','How do we know about dinosaurs if no people saw them?','from fossils','from photos','from films',0,'What is a fossil?','a living dinosaur','a dinosaur bone that turned to stone over a very long time','a kind of egg',1,'Which animals alive today are a kind of dinosaur?','cats','fish','birds',2,'Write the word: fossil','fossil','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TF-12-03','Spot the Word, Tari',12,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','What does Tari decide to hunt for on the town signs?','four special ''traveller words''','number plates','birds',0,'Where does she find the words?','only in glass cases','out in the real world, on shops, bottles and road signs','in a book',1,'How many traveller words does Tari find in all?','two','three','four',2,'Write the word: word','word','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TF-12-04','Okon''s Garden',12,'Tafiya Fiction','comprehension','What did Bem and Okon share before Okon moved?','a garden patch and a plant','a bike','a dog',0,'How does Bem get to see Okon again?','he drives to his town','a video call set up by his mum','he writes a letter',1,'What has Okon started in his new home?','nothing','a football team','his own plant patch, the same kind',2,'Write the word: garden','garden','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('SF-12-01','Idris and the Dry Tap',12,'Stamina Fiction','comprehension','What problem sends Idris looking for help?','every tap on the estate is dry','a flood','a broken window',0,'What does Mr Tanko teach Idris about a dry tap?','hit it harder','the tap is only the end of the line; follow the pipe back to the source','buy a new tap',1,'What had actually caused it?','no rain for weeks','a burst pipe','the pump''s switch had flicked off, so the tank emptied',2,'Write the word: pump','pump','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('SN-12-01','The Springs of Ikogosi',12,'Stamina NF','comprehension','What is special about the two springs at Ikogosi?','one is warm and one is cold','both are boiling','both are frozen',0,'What is the place where two streams meet called?','a spring','a confluence','a desert',1,'What amazing thing happens when the warm and cold streams meet?','they turn to steam','they vanish','they flow side by side without mixing',2,'Write the word: springs','springs','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('TD-12-01','The Tempest',12,'Tafiya Duniya','comprehension','Why is Prospero living on the island?','his brother stole his lands and cast him out to sea','he is on holiday','he was born there',0,'What does Prospero do when his enemies'' ship passes?','sinks it at once','raises a great storm to bring them ashore','ignores it',1,'What does Prospero finally choose over revenge?','more anger','to sail away and hide','to forgive his brother',2,'Write the word: forgive','forgive','Tip: let''s look back at that part of the book together.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
